----------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCIES AND ATTRIBUTIONS
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This project interacts with and integrates optional features from the
following third-party tools, libraries, and specifications:

1. Blender glTF 2.0 Exporter (io_scene_gltf2)
   - Used for scene geometry, armature, and material export.
   - License: GPL-2.0-or-later / GPL-3.0-or-later
   - Source: https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Blender-IO

2. Three.js / WebGL Ecosystem
   - Target rendering framework for exported models, binary animations, and generated TypeScript helpers.
   - License: MIT License
   - Website: https://threejs.org / https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js

3. Draco Mesh Compression (Google Draco)
   - Optional 3D geometry compression library supported during GLB export.
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Repository: https://github.com/google/draco

4. UVPackmaster 2 / 3 (Optional Third-Party Addon)
   - Optional external UV island packing engine integration.
   - If unavailable, Web3D Asset Compiler gracefully falls back to Blender's native packing algorithms.
   - Website: https://uvpackmaster.com
